{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>外交部斥日本有人藉電視劇挑動反華情緒。</p><p></p><p>在北京，外交部指，日本有人試圖透過文化產品挑動反華情緒。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人郭嘉昆說：「這部電視劇再次暴露出，日本國內始終存在一股勢力，企圖通過文化產品醜化、抹黑中國，散播仇華情緒，應當引起國際社會和日本國內有識之士的警惕。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T09:21:57.330290+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:19.407999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T09:18:19.407999+00:00","content_hash":"6fc582fb128db4bdcf1f16c61c0ec6aaa059d141dff7bc0d6951d95e0f9e6b01","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}